=== directory components
*/f: d1/f d2/f
d*/: d1/ d2/
*/*/: d1/sub/ t/a/ t/c/
*/.x: d1/.x
d*/f/: d*/f/
nope*/f: nope*/f
./d*/: ./d1/ ./d2/
quoted slash: d2/g
whole result sorted: a-b/z a/z
=== failglob
subshell rc=1
message: no match: *.none
failglob beats nullglob rc=1
matches still run: d1/f d2/f
=== GLOBIGNORE
ignore *.dot:d1: .hid a a-b d2 plain t
ignore everything: */f
unset again: a a-b d1 d2 plain t
=== globstar
t/**/*.sh: t/a/b/z.sh t/a/y.sh t/x.sh
t/**: t/ t/a t/a/b t/a/b/z.sh t/a/y.sh t/c t/c/w.txt t/x.sh
t/**/: t/ t/a/ t/a/b/ t/c/
**/z: a-b/z a/z
globstar off: t/a/y.sh
=== nocasematch
case: match
case bracket: match
[[ ]]: match
case off: no match
